{"data":{"body":"[P2] Stop draining new completions after the enclosing spans have ended. If `onOperationChange` arrives while this final `forceFlush()` is blocked, this call subsequently emits an operation span after its Invocation or terminal Workflow parent ended, producing invalid span boundaries. Reach completion quiescence before ending parents, then perform only a provider flush here. Apply the same ordering to `InvocationOtelPlugin` and add a blocked-final-flush containment test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77IYxr","finding_digest":"5485c6f5c7a060fb823ae9bd47d5197106c6aca5c4ebec01884e70c5887626b9","finding_id":"arf_v1_ksc4n5ohubqpxar25g6upvizoe","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::late-completion-outside-invocation-boundary","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::late-completion-outside-invocation-boundary","line":414,"observation_digest":"d4ec2dccb725c927717ce30b4c39a04c8c82287e0205fac95f7bba7190d61c03","observation_id":"aro_v1_2twc3tfxexeso4l44mfuyonajs","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ksc4n5ohubqpxar25g6upvizoe","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:07:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w2fxx25xg5vb4q5uioms35n3al","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"d569c9f6cf71f0e2325f7ddd1bd7a75d4d5e98ff","reviewer":"codex","start_line":414,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_2k2gb4yvcqrr3shoiq4wruiygh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:07:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
